-- A formerly-live key. The hop before the despawn resolves and is silent; the same hop after
-- it is DEAD twice, once per row that still names the departed id.
--! registry despawned-world
--! expect-n 4
--! expect id = 7 13 17 19
--! expect gold = 0 0 0 11

mentor.Dead , Gold += 1
Cursed , ~
Nord & mentor.Dead , Gold += 10
